  "title": "Faster than the bus",
  "goal": "Compare two people, places or things with -DAn daha: İstanbul Ankara'dan daha kalabalık.",
  "points": ["gp-comparative"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Put what you compare with in the ablative, then *daha* (more) and the adjective: *Tren otobüsten daha hızlı* (The train is faster than the bus). *Daha* alone means **-er**, **more**: *Bu daha ucuz* (This one is cheaper). For **less**, say *daha az*.",
    "see": "gp-comparative"
  },
